  "reference_solution": "[정답] $16$\n\n[해설]\n$\\lim_{x \\rightarrow 1} \\frac{g (x)}{x^{2} - 1} = \\frac{1}{2}$이므로 $\\lim_{x \\rightarrow 1} \\frac{x^{2} - 1}{g (x)} = 2$\n$\\lim_{x \\rightarrow 1} \\frac{(x + 1) f (x)}{g (x)} = \\lim_{x \\rightarrow 1} \\left\\{ \\frac{f (x)}{x - 1} \\times \\frac{x^{2} - 1}{g (x)} \\right\\}$\n$= 8 \\times 2 = 16$\n",
